title: MS Exchange: Size of mailbox databases
agents: windows
catalog: app/exchange
license: GPL
distribution: heinlein
description:
 This check receives data from the agent plugin msexch_database_size.ps1
 and shows the size of the databases.

 Thresholds can be configured for the total database size and the
 percentage of available new mailbox space within the database.

item:
 The name of the mailbox database.

discovery:
 One check for each mailbox database will be created.
